  "post_content": "<p>Este mi&eacute;rcoles, con la finalizaci&oacute;n del&nbsp;trimestre escolar, han acabado tambi&eacute;n en el colegio Virgen el Carmen de Onda las numerosas actividades y talleres que que se han realizado en los &uacute;ltimos d&iacute;as.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/04/IMG_20841.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>La tarde del mi&eacute;rcoles, en el sal&oacute;n de actos, el alumnado de 1&ordm;, 2&ordm; y 3&ordm; de ESO ha presentado los trabajos desarrollados en los seis talleres en que se han distribuido (en las fotos, el de Periodistas por un d&iacute;a, mientras se repart&iacute;an las gallestas elaboradas en otro taller).</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/workshopvolunteersvergedelcarme/img_2079.jpg\" alt=\"img_2079\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/workshopvolunteersvergedelcarme/img_2081.jpg\" alt=\"img_2081\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/workshopvolunteersvergedelcarme/img_2082.jpg\" alt=\"img_2082\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/workshopvolunteersvergedelcarme/img_2083.jpg\" alt=\"img_2083\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/workshopvolunteersvergedelcarme/img_2084.jpg\" alt=\"img_2084\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/workshopvolunteersvergedelcarme/img_2085.jpg\" alt=\"img_2085\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/workshopvolunteersvergedelcarme/img_2086.jpg\" alt=\"img_2086\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/workshopvolunteersvergedelcarme/img_2088.jpg\" alt=\"img_2088\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/workshopvolunteersvergedelcarme/img_2089.jpg\" alt=\"img_2089\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/workshopvolunteersvergedelcarme/img_2090.jpg\" alt=\"img_2090\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/workshopvolunteersvergedelcarme/img_2091.jpg\" alt=\"img_2091\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/workshopvolunteersvergedelcarme/img_2092.jpg\" alt=\"img_2092\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/workshopvolunteersvergedelcarme/img_2093.jpg\" alt=\"img_2093\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /></div>"
